{"id":"4017583518481243795","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"🎬【25/10 冼靖峰《ARCHIETECT LIVE IN HONG KONG》演唱會・記者招待會】圓滿成功！🔥\n\n🩷 30 秒重溫當日精彩花絮！✨\n\n由 Archie 登場，到記者招待會嘅每個精彩時刻，再到同弓箭手🏹嘅遊戲互動， 每一幕都記錄住當日嘅歡樂與感動！📸🫶🏻\n短短 30 幾秒，帶大家再次重溫當日嘅點點滴滴，感受 Archie 嘅舞台魅力同現場熱鬧氣氛！❤️‍🔥\n記者招待會雖然已經圓滿結束， 但我哋對《ARCHIETECT LIVE IN HONG KONG》嘅期待，依然持續升溫！🎤🔥\n\n🏹 弓箭手們，記得買飛入場支持 Archie， 一齊期待演唱會嘅到來， 創造更多屬於我哋嘅難忘回憶！🥰🩷\n@archie_sin  @allaboutmusic.hk \n#ArchieSin #冼靖峰 #弓箭手 #ARCHIETECTLIVEINHONGKONG","username":"archiesinofficialfansclub","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@archiesinofficialfansclub/post/DfBUuyKid6T","timestamp":"2026-10-28T02:08:38Z","media_type":"VIDEO","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-28T11:31:42.184986658Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-28T11:32:06.008745Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-28T11:32:06.008745Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_7be4138009bb7eb8","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
